    {
      "event": "committed",
      "id": null,
      "node_id": "C_kwDOABII59oAKGRmNGVkZDYzYjBiMzI3M2Q5ZGJiMTBkMTBiZDVlYmMzNmViNzY0MDY",
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitcoin/bitcoin/git/commits/df4edd63b0b3273d9dbb10d10bd5ebc36eb76406",
      "actor": null,
      "commit_id": null,
      "commit_url": null,
      "created_at": null,
      "html_url": "https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/commit/df4edd63b0b3273d9dbb10d10bd5ebc36eb76406",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "bc0484590c9f25ac28aa1e1c8b2ccfe6eb03e74a",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitcoin/bitcoin/git/trees/bc0484590c9f25ac28aa1e1c8b2ccfe6eb03e74a"
      },
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree bc0484590c9f25ac28aa1e1c8b2ccfe6eb03e74a\nparent daacf03e0ac8983a50f8c6692dfbf3f86fd89ce4\nauthor Ryan Ofsky <ryan@ofsky.org> 1790726098 +0000\ncommitter fanquake <fanquake@gmail.com> 1795639016 +0000\n\ndepends: store local package tarballs in WORK_PATH instead of SOURCES_PATH\n\nLocal packages (packages with $(package)_local_dir set) are built from a\ntarball of the local directory, which is regenerated at parse time when any\nfile in the directory is newer than the tarball. The tarball was stored in\nSOURCES_PATH next to downloaded sources. But unlike downloaded sources, it has\nno fixed name or hash identifying its contents, so when SOURCES_PATH is shared\nbetween checkouts, a checkout can find another checkout's tarball, see no\nnewer files, and build from the wrong sources.\n\nThis happens reliably with contrib/guix/guix-build, which shares SOURCES_PATH\nwith its build container and mounts every checkout at /bitcoin inside it, so\nall checkouts use the same tarball path. The host `make download-*` step it\nruns first also sets the mtimes of local directory files to 2000-01-01, so no\ncheckout ever sees files newer than a tarball another checkout created.\n\nStore local package tarballs and their download stamps in\nWORK_PATH/local-sources instead. WORK_PATH defaults to the checkout's\ndepends/work directory, so each checkout gets its own tarball.\n\nA side benefit is that when sources have been downloaded beforehand, as\nguix-build does, building no longer writes to SOURCES_PATH, so a shared\nSOURCES_PATH can be mounted read-only in build containers.\n\nThis change was written with Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context).\n\nGithub-Pull: #35765\nRebased-From: 01491f22b2c77d632e8503cc446140d1ab6ccc21\n",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJPBAABCAA5FiEEz7FuIclQ9n+pXlWPLuufXMCVJsEFAmsHRugbFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMCwzAAoJEC7rn1zAlSbBDM8P/2b2OKnQRUyG+S7Wr38n\nRVcmkNjFpDK4E//hjaZVcEw5Aq7PrqB6y7wlZVWgvPbK/JueH4vooprl7U+ea/Zh\nE19adDG9YXK5zFDn9/HSzodGhXGzPd9FPYCuGppO0klOZuuURShNHUXlctu9gySM\n27tVLtiIS3hFuGqN267VMVJd6MatEFOCs3vBTw6DuXwoEJ448b3iFAy/k7h5vraS\n9RPwv7bfw0YbquhPd0NE4rucpw016ujHEVTaN0eT3ZKaRx4TQCAgNyQCwcsuylXX\nlXzpv6mAsYF+SaWGQohgEhTtCReVLzbwDCv7knpcK/K+RBEpAD1FdmOLO6NGiU6I\nLa2JMkwoMd5N5b2Am/l2HLFykOL9uuzPmj1hNXPBYFb2q2aYD9OVP1Zd15G8zTeD\nnm6uYUpRiaWScYCYMcJ06xRBtTAxoEYxYsAcBvZAyTM3PzcNh1r+eYs3O0pSdh/w\nucipfrhSoGEkl+CuXVusn8ud1RKvu9n7Z4lg6/lVPC/Cafo353uWtEFzEiWHtOre\nJMsvixBhsTzG51KjV0Wnw7yKdx4cBoMaBzWxqIdwTQvdw7Zhg7MzniB6mjfjy/+Y\nqrhyTL/fkzya2IiyPEMPDwsHi6wG9CzkFlD2EIyLPFv1ohQOP30Ne3xt/VVVbqzi\ndYXkjkM/l8Vqcz3uxoNlSfkA\n=0dHs\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----"
